1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:03,400
Is that you, Yamane?

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,340
Kashiwagi?

4
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:10,466
Yamane, do you work here?

5
00:00:10,466 --> 00:00:12,846
Oh, I do...

6
00:00:14,086 --> 00:00:15,984
Well...

7
00:00:15,984 --> 00:00:18,583
I was transferred here temporarily.

8
00:00:19,811 --> 00:00:24,396
So you're the one
our parent company sent over, huh?

9
00:00:24,396 --> 00:00:25,586
Yeah.

10
00:00:28,016 --> 00:00:31,296
Kashiwagi, you haven't changed at all.

11
00:00:31,296 --> 00:00:33,306
- Really?
- Yeah.

12
00:00:33,306 --> 00:00:36,766
Yamane, you've become really beautiful.

13
00:00:38,346 --> 00:00:39,776
What?

14
00:00:40,496 --> 00:00:41,756
Wow, I'm so happy.

15
00:00:41,756 --> 00:00:44,856
Ms. Yamane, the meeting.

16
00:00:44,856 --> 00:00:47,536
- Right.
- Huh?

17
00:00:47,536 --> 00:00:51,056
Are you Taguchi?

18
00:00:51,056 --> 00:00:52,586
I'm Kashiwagi.

19
00:00:52,586 --> 00:00:55,226
We were in the same class freshman year.

20
00:00:56,496 --> 00:00:59,896
Sorry. I don't quite remember.

21
00:00:59,896 --> 00:01:01,486
I see.

22
00:01:01,486 --> 00:01:05,786
Wow, that's amazing.
I can't believe you two work together.

23
00:01:06,566 --> 00:01:09,856
I haven't told the company
that I know Ms. Yamane.

24
00:01:09,856 --> 00:01:12,536
Oh, really?

25
00:01:12,536 --> 00:01:15,236
Hey, let's all go out for dinner sometime.

26
00:01:15,236 --> 00:01:16,856
If there's time.

27
00:01:59,926 --> 00:02:03,926
I'm Kei Kashiwagi,
from Restarise Corporation.

28
00:02:03,926 --> 00:02:08,336
I've been assigned to join this project
starting today.

29
00:02:08,336 --> 00:02:11,976
I will do my best. Please take care of me.

30
00:02:12,686 --> 00:02:16,106
Okay, everyone, give him a warm welcome.

31
00:02:17,046 --> 00:02:18,109
- Ms. Yamane.
- Yes?

32
00:02:18,109 --> 00:02:20,096
Could you show him around the office?

33
00:02:20,096 --> 00:02:21,336
Yes.

34
00:02:25,036 --> 00:02:28,696
Nice to see you again, Ms. Yamane.

35
00:02:28,696 --> 00:02:30,696
Likewise.

36
00:02:30,696 --> 00:02:32,786
Do you know each other?

37
00:02:32,786 --> 00:02:36,226
Actually, we were classmates in high school.

38
00:02:36,226 --> 00:02:38,786
Wow, that's incredible.

39
00:02:38,786 --> 00:02:40,756
I was shocked too.

40
00:02:41,576 --> 00:02:44,666
I was surprised as well.

41
00:02:45,806 --> 00:02:48,276
So you haven't met since high school?

42
00:02:48,276 --> 00:02:49,826
No, we haven't.

43
00:02:49,826 --> 00:02:51,576
Yeah.

44
00:02:57,426 --> 00:03:03,349
[Can I call you?]

45
00:03:33,806 --> 00:03:36,365
[Good night]

46
00:03:44,278 --> 00:03:45,848
Ms. Yamane!

47
00:03:48,966 --> 00:03:52,896
Are you free now? It's about the committee.

48
00:03:55,256 --> 00:03:56,926
Sorry, just a sec.

49
00:03:58,746 --> 00:03:59,956
Yes?

50
00:04:00,906 --> 00:04:04,806
We're making posters
for recommended books tomorrow.

51
00:04:04,806 --> 00:04:09,166
If you're free after school,
could you help me?

52
00:04:13,176 --> 00:04:15,556
Sure, I'm free.

53
00:04:15,556 --> 00:04:17,176
Thanks as always.

54
00:04:19,801 --> 00:04:22,326
Coffee? That's unusual.

55
00:04:22,326 --> 00:04:24,816
Well, I accidentally ordered an extra...

56
00:04:24,816 --> 00:04:27,046
I'll take it. How much?

57
00:04:27,046 --> 00:04:28,966
Oh no, it's fine.

58
00:04:28,966 --> 00:04:30,186
Here.

59
00:04:33,523 --> 00:04:34,983
Thank you.

60
00:04:42,376 --> 00:04:45,676
So, is that all?

61
00:04:47,246 --> 00:04:48,486
Yeah.

62
00:04:49,726 --> 00:04:51,226
Bye, then.

63
00:04:52,526 --> 00:04:54,136
Taguchi.

64
00:04:56,916 --> 00:04:59,366
Hey, thanks for this.

65
00:05:00,298 --> 00:05:01,558
Sure.

66
00:05:04,436 --> 00:05:06,706
Are you two close?

67
00:05:06,706 --> 00:05:07,916
Huh?

68
00:05:12,216 --> 00:05:13,696
Never mind.

69
00:05:50,326 --> 00:05:52,216
- Ms. Yamane.
- Yes?

70
00:05:52,216 --> 00:05:56,536
When should we start developing
for the field test?

71
00:05:56,536 --> 00:05:59,416
Well, first we need to coordinate
with the school,

72
00:05:59,416 --> 00:06:05,236
sort out the required tasks,
and execute them, so...

73
00:06:07,926 --> 00:06:10,106
Should we hold off for now?

74
00:06:10,106 --> 00:06:13,286
Sorry, just a second.

75
00:06:13,286 --> 00:06:15,746
That's fine.

76
00:06:15,746 --> 00:06:20,126
We'll talk to the school about
making the manual and training, okay?

77
00:06:20,126 --> 00:06:22,136
Understood. Thank you.

78
00:06:22,136 --> 00:06:23,956
Let us know if you have questions.

79
00:06:23,956 --> 00:06:25,466
Okay.

80
00:06:25,466 --> 00:06:26,688
Sorry.

81
00:06:27,596 --> 00:06:28,806
Thank you.

82
00:06:28,806 --> 00:06:30,136
No problem.

83
00:06:34,626 --> 00:06:37,196
- You're impressive, Kashiwagi.
- Huh?

84
00:06:37,196 --> 00:06:39,736
You already understand the project details.

85
00:06:39,736 --> 00:06:42,586
I crammed when I found out I was joining.

86
00:06:42,586 --> 00:06:43,876
I see.

87
00:06:43,876 --> 00:06:48,196
But you're a huge help,
since you've been here longer.

88
00:06:48,196 --> 00:06:50,076
I'm not that great.

89
00:07:21,766 --> 00:07:23,466
Good work today.

90
00:07:23,466 --> 00:07:25,426
You too.

91
00:07:36,916 --> 00:07:38,296
So...

92
00:07:42,236 --> 00:07:44,716
I heard from Ms. Yamane...

93
00:07:45,776 --> 00:07:50,986
that you've been giving her advice.

94
00:07:52,666 --> 00:07:57,936
She said she's been
relying on you for a long time.

95
00:07:59,596 --> 00:08:01,126
She seemed happy.

96
00:08:04,906 --> 00:08:06,676
Happy?

97
00:08:08,836 --> 00:08:10,416
Yes.

98
00:08:17,496 --> 00:08:22,696
I've been with Ms. Yamane
ever since she joined the company.

99
00:08:24,246 --> 00:08:26,196
She's a really...

100
00:08:27,976 --> 00:08:29,856
lovely co-worker.

101
00:08:33,396 --> 00:08:34,806
That's why...

102
00:08:36,056 --> 00:08:41,106
I was worried you might hurt her
when you joined.

103
00:08:45,346 --> 00:08:46,806
But...

104
00:08:48,446 --> 00:08:50,846
I worried too much.

105
00:08:53,036 --> 00:08:56,326
You two have such a nice vibe.

106
00:08:57,496 --> 00:09:00,956
When she told me you weren't dating,

107
00:09:00,956 --> 00:09:03,706
I was really surprised.

108
00:09:06,066 --> 00:09:07,296
Huh?

109
00:09:08,706 --> 00:09:11,166
Did we look like a couple?

110
00:09:15,456 --> 00:09:16,806
Yeah.

111
00:09:18,851 --> 00:09:23,506
There's an application form for that.
I'll send it to you later.

112
00:09:23,506 --> 00:09:25,366
Thank you.

113
00:09:34,206 --> 00:09:36,306
You two make a great pair.

114
00:09:40,826 --> 00:09:42,326
Is that so?

115
00:09:45,816 --> 00:09:50,676
I didn't know Ms. Ohata thought that way.

116
00:09:50,676 --> 00:09:54,406
I was nervous, but she's really nice.

117
00:10:22,596 --> 00:10:24,646
I was happy.

118
00:10:30,176 --> 00:10:32,226
I actually...

119
00:10:34,056 --> 00:10:35,986
remember Kashiwagi.

120
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,630
Huh?

121
00:10:42,056 --> 00:10:44,726
I lied because I felt uncomfortable.

122
00:10:50,726 --> 00:10:52,426
Of course,

123
00:10:54,086 --> 00:10:56,966
he didn't do anything wrong, but...

124
00:10:59,986 --> 00:11:02,907
[Yamane]

125
00:11:04,346 --> 00:11:08,146
I feel like Taguchi has been down lately.

126
00:11:10,736 --> 00:11:12,736
Did something happen?

127
00:11:13,566 --> 00:11:15,796
I don't know.

128
00:11:15,796 --> 00:11:18,706
We haven't really talked properly.

129
00:11:18,706 --> 00:11:20,126
I see.

130
00:11:24,616 --> 00:11:28,326
I wonder what I can do
to be more like a girlfriend.

131
00:11:29,757 --> 00:11:31,387
What should you do?

132
00:11:34,356 --> 00:11:36,446
A date, maybe.

133
00:11:36,446 --> 00:11:37,746
Yeah.

134
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:42,660
Anything else?

135
00:11:44,070 --> 00:11:47,870
Anything else? Well...

136
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:53,530
Things that couples do.

137
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,990
That's what I need to know.

138
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:02,710
Well... I don't know either.

139
00:12:02,710 --> 00:12:05,011
Why not ask AI?

140
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,320
AI...

141
00:12:10,590 --> 00:12:12,810
What do I even ask?

142
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:17,760
Things that couples do?

143
00:12:21,290 --> 00:12:27,970
Did I... do something to make him hate me?

144
00:12:53,330 --> 00:12:56,220
"Introduce him to your friends."

145
00:12:57,780 --> 00:13:00,750
"Try changing how you call each other."

146
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:09,330
"A date at home."

147
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,780
You look so serious.

148
00:13:16,463 --> 00:13:19,863
Mr. Taguchi...

149
00:13:25,330 --> 00:13:26,550
So, you see...

150
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:28,760
Great.

151
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:31,040
You're here.

152
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,710
Ms. Yamane, sorry.

153
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:36,500
I need to ask something about the school
for the field test.

154
00:13:37,410 --> 00:13:39,100
Are you free now?

155
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:43,490
Yeah, now's fine.

156
00:13:51,130 --> 00:13:53,310
Oh, right!

157
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,620
Let's all go to dinner.

158
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:14,370
Are you really okay not turning him down?

159
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,820
Well, yeah.

160
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:20,710
We can't keep saying no forever.

161
00:14:24,980 --> 00:14:27,770
But let's keep our relationship a secret.

162
00:14:29,450 --> 00:14:30,730
Okay.

163
00:14:32,290 --> 00:14:35,030
I wanna tell him though, honestly.

164
00:14:35,030 --> 00:14:38,010
To keep his hands off the girl I care about.

165
00:14:43,700 --> 00:14:46,100
Sorry. The restroom was packed.

166
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:47,930
Oh, it's fine.

167
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:53,290
All right then, once again...

168
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:56,910
To our reunion.

169
00:14:56,910 --> 00:14:59,410
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

170
00:15:02,390 --> 00:15:04,270
Thank you for waiting.

171
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:06,460
Thank you.

172
00:15:09,890 --> 00:15:12,890
What do you do on your days off?

173
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:18,740
I read books and watch movies.

174
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:20,270
You're still into that?

175
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:21,460
Yeah.

176
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:23,220
I am too.

177
00:15:23,220 --> 00:15:26,260
I also play futsal sometimes.

178
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:28,420
Right, you played soccer.

179
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,200
Yep, that's right.

180
00:15:30,890 --> 00:15:33,060
- And you, Taguchi?
- Huh?

181
00:15:34,690 --> 00:15:36,880
Taguchi's into books...

182
00:15:38,475 --> 00:15:40,225
Or are you?

183
00:15:41,691 --> 00:15:45,740
I read sometimes and play games too.

184
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:47,130
I see.

185
00:15:48,570 --> 00:15:54,420
It feels refreshing, chatting like this,
the three of us.

186
00:15:55,730 --> 00:15:58,280
It's like a class reunion.

187
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:03,610
Did you two go to the reunion?

188
00:16:03,610 --> 00:16:07,270
Yeah, I went, but left early.

189
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:09,150
Me too.

190
00:16:09,150 --> 00:16:13,520
I see... I was late.

191
00:16:15,170 --> 00:16:16,960
Did you two meet?

192
00:16:17,730 --> 00:16:19,520
No, we didn't meet.

193
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:24,940
So we all haven't met since high school.

194
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:38,060
Actually, we reunited at the class reunion.

195
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,860
Huh?

196
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:42,680
Then Taguchi joined the company.

197
00:16:54,223 --> 00:16:59,623
And now... we're dating.

198
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:16,620
Kashiwagi?

199
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:25,250
I think...

200
00:17:27,790 --> 00:17:29,730
that's really great.

201
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:32,480
Huh?

202
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:34,610
Well...

203
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:37,197
Back in high school,

204
00:17:37,197 --> 00:17:41,550
I saw you two together
at the summer festival.

205
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,860
It was such an unexpected pair...

206
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:49,670
It really struck me.

207
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:53,660
But...

208
00:17:56,450 --> 00:18:01,810
Actually, I planned that class reunion.

209
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:10,820
I was hoping you two would reconnect.

210
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:13,970
I guess it wasn't needed
since you met at work.

211
00:18:13,970 --> 00:18:19,180
No, it mattered. We reunited that day,

212
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:24,940
and that's when I realized
Taguchi was special to me.

213
00:18:27,410 --> 00:18:29,490
So thank you.

214
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:36,690
I'm so glad.

215
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:44,740
Sorry.

216
00:18:45,850 --> 00:18:47,160
Huh?

217
00:18:48,290 --> 00:18:49,490
I...

218
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,630
do remember you.

219
00:18:54,968 --> 00:18:56,518
I...

220
00:18:58,280 --> 00:19:01,270
just didn't know what to say at the time.

221
00:19:04,780 --> 00:19:06,600
I'm really sorry.

222
00:19:08,620 --> 00:19:11,270
It's fine. Don't worry about it at all.

223
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:15,750
Thank you.

224
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:21,940
All right. Let's drink tonight!

225
00:19:25,402 --> 00:19:27,942
That was a big surprise today.

226
00:19:30,150 --> 00:19:32,310
Did you say it for my sake?

227
00:19:33,930 --> 00:19:35,140
Yeah.

228
00:19:37,590 --> 00:19:39,310
Are you mad?

229
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:41,620
No.

230
00:19:44,380 --> 00:19:46,150
I'm falling for you again.

231
00:19:49,570 --> 00:19:51,990
Because you were so cool.

232
00:19:55,190 --> 00:19:58,720
No one's ever said that to me before.

233
00:19:59,710 --> 00:20:01,110
I see.

234
00:20:02,910 --> 00:20:07,370
Hey, I wanted to ask you something.

235
00:20:07,370 --> 00:20:08,730
What is it?

236
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:15,390
I've been thinking about
where to go for our next date.

237
00:20:17,250 --> 00:20:19,180
Thought of anything?

238
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:21,110
Yeah.

239
00:20:21,110 --> 00:20:22,530
Where?

240
00:20:23,630 --> 00:20:25,750
Your place, Taguchi.

241
00:20:30,147 --> 00:20:31,717
My place?

242
00:20:34,651 --> 00:20:37,151
It's okay if you don't want to.

243
00:20:41,930 --> 00:20:43,140
Then...

244
00:20:46,705 --> 00:20:48,205
want to come over now?

245
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:50,530
Now?

246
00:20:51,570 --> 00:20:52,790
Yeah.

247
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:58,570
I want you to stay.

248
00:21:02,596 --> 00:21:04,406
Coming in.

249
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:17,620
Taguchi...

250
00:21:20,245 --> 00:21:22,635
Why are you using my last name?

251
00:21:25,356 --> 00:21:26,796
But...

252
00:21:41,650 --> 00:21:43,270
Use my first name.

253
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,810
Ryosuke.

254
00:22:19,907 --> 00:22:21,527
Are you really sure?

255
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:28,010
I won't do anything you don't want.

256
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:38,590
I...

257
00:22:47,150 --> 00:22:49,050
I want to...

258
00:22:50,310 --> 00:22:52,350
do couple-like things

259
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:56,950
with you, too, Ryosuke.

260
00:23:30,350 --> 00:23:34,760
Did we manage to do
at least one couple thing?

261
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:36,980
How far do couple things go?

262
00:23:36,980 --> 00:23:38,100
Wait a second.

263
00:23:38,100 --> 00:23:39,980
If we go further, I won't stop.

264
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:42,330
Your communication skills are amazing.

265
00:23:42,330 --> 00:23:43,630
We're going to Sushiro.

266
00:23:43,630 --> 00:23:46,530
I'm heading to a meeting with Kashiwagi.

267
00:23:46,530 --> 00:23:50,090
I never thought I'd see you make that face.

268
00:23:50,090 --> 00:23:52,180
After you transferred schools,

269
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:55,910
Ms. Yamane was really depressed.

270
00:23:55,910 --> 00:23:57,875
I can say this now, but...

271
00:23:58,730 --> 00:24:00,160
I...

272
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,160

